| P2 (ID) Inquirer, P2 (ID) Inferer | Identity question series and profile updates. Recurring slots on request |

Free weekday slots: 6:50am, 7:15am (offered to Safekeeper), 2:30pm and 4:50pm. Keep 7:45 to 11:45am clear for the chain.

